        merrHardOnlyFmt: "Out of {total} frames, <strong>{hard}</strong> have invalid uncertainty (<code>MERR ≥ 1.00m</code> or <code>≤ 0</code>) and will be automatically rejected because AAVSO WebObs does not accept them.",
